#: ../../howto/discussions.rst:190
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Recovery puts back the files as they were. It refuses to overwrite a "
#| "file someone edited since. ``dsc`` also checks each change before it "
#| "writes anything: an empty or cut-short record, or an index without its "
#| "generated region, is refused. When memory runs out, the command stops "
